   "target_strand": "post/imperial_knowledge",
   "target_strand_note": "imperial_knowledge ('Imperial knowledge and cultural authority'; 'Texts acquire authority through institutions and citation; individual writers remain consequential'; works: Orientalism, 1978) holds him alone and matches the checked argument, including his insistence on individual authors (p. 23). The strand's works field could add Culture and Imperialism (1993) at release.",
